<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for March 17-23 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>	     March 17-23  March 18-24     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    395,009.8   433,224.4</p>
<p> Production		 0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  13,429.1    25,378.6     865,500.4    705,465.0</p>
<p> Home Market	  347.5	 250.0	12,393.6     14,296.2</p>
<p> Stocks/close   381,233.2   407,595.8</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
